WEBVTT

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:18.950
I'm sorry-

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.400
Queen's Circus

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:35.540
<i>Even I think my head's gone funny.</i>

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:42.690
<i>That I would fall in love for such a little thing...</i>

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:49.050
Sekai-ichi Hatsukoi

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.400
Book returns?

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:50.270
Saga Masamune

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:09.850
<i>I think "love at first sight" is an extremely meaningless phrase.</i>

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:22.310
<i>How much can you know about someone just by meeting them once?</i>

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:27.390
<i>Besides, we're both guys.</i>

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:30.110
<i>We've never even spoken to each other.</i>

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:35.770
<i>I'm borrowing the book that senpai borrowed.</i>

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:37.710
<i>It's not much.</i>

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:45.780
<i>But just by doing this I feel like I'm getting closer
to Senpai now.</i>

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:45.600
Onodera Ritsu

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.430
<i>Eh, what I am thinking!?</i>

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.100
<i>That's weird!</i>

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:54.290
<i>Oh well, it's just a temporary infatuation...</i>

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.700
Oda Ritsu

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:02.930
<i>That's what I thought for 3 whole years.</i>

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:09.080
<i>But then that day suddenly came.</i>

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:09.960
-Three Years Later-

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:18.250
Saga-senpai!

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:22.050
<i>One sided love is...</i>

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:26.620
One sided Love Liquid

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.820
<i>...something that everyone has a container for.</i>

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:29.620
Why do you know my name?

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:35.780
<i>To confess or not to... depends on the balance
between reason and self-confidence.</i>

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.860
<i>When he spoke to me, because it was so sudden,</i>

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:46.270
<i>surprise and excitement made all my love up until now overflow.</i>

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:49.360
<i>It exceeded the container's limit all in one go.</i>

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:52.620
<i>Was there something wrong with me?</i>

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:57.340
I like you... Senpai.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:02.530
Huh, no... I mean...

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:09.840
Do you want to go out with me?

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:16.080
No! I mean... not no... umm...

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:17.060
It's fine.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:19.000
I'll go out with you.

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:29.690
<i>It's like a dream... getting to walk with Senpai...</i>

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:36.040
<i>What's more... it's his h-h-house that we're going to...</i>

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.030
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:39.170
<i>I-I am really nervous!</i>

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.610
I don't think you need to be that nervous.

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:45.020
<i>How did he know?</i>

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:49.460
I'm basically living by myself now.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:50.900
There's no one else at home.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:55.220
Are your parents out on a vacation?

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:57.840
Yeah... well, something like that.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:02.390
<i>Huh? Did I ask something I shouldn't have?</i>

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:05.550
I'm back, Sorata.

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:09.770
<i>That cat...</i>

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:13.350
I'm going to get drinks for us, so you just go up first.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.330
It's the room on the right once you go up the stairs.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.380
Oh, okay.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:28.030
<i>Wow.</i>

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:29.720
<i>Books everywhere.</i>

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:34.110
<i>S-Senpai's bed...</i>

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:36.350
<i>This is bad...</i>

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:40.410
<i>I was overcome by a crazy desire just now...</i>

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:43.420
<i>Stop it! it's his house.</i>

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:45.480
<i>If I did that...</i>

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:46.930
<i>But...</i>

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.070
<i>Now's my only chance...</i>

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:51.860
<i>Before Senpai comes...</i>

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.010
<i>Just for a little while...</i>

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:56.210
<i>No good!</i>

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:57.420
<i>But...</i>

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:59.010
<i>No one's looking!</i>

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:00.480
<i>But...</i>

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:12.970
<i>I-I did it...</i>

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.970
<i>My dream for the past 3 years...</i>

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:16.770
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.250
<i>I think I just might die now!</i>

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.230
Is Oolong tea okay?

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:24.530
Uh, y-yeah!

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.460
Want to watch a DVD?

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.010
Y-yeah.

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:30.590
Anything's fine.

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:36.760
<i>Uh, aren't we sitting a little too close?</i>

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:37.940
Sorry.

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.620
My room's messy.

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:40.240
Huh?

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.010
It's not.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.580
I like rooms full of books.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:45.780
Hey...

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.170
Y-yes?

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:51.110
Why do you like me so much?

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.880
That's because...

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.410
You don't know anything about me.

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:02.000
T-That maybe the case, but I do know somethings about you.

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:04.240
Like, the cat before...

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:05.300
Cat?

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.240
Ah, s-sorry.

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:11.040
I was watching you.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:15.460
On a rainy day, an abandoned kitten was crying.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.260
All the people who passed by ignored it.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:19.830
Except for Senpai...

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:22.740
What!?

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:25.450
What's with you? You were watching that?

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:26.950
S-Sorry!

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:30.520
What's this...!

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:33.760
If I get spotted doing something like out of a shoujo manga,

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.370
what I am supposed to do?

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:38.370
Oh, sorry, I...

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:41.170
I don't read manga, so I'm not able to understand.

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:43.880
Is that so.

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:45.280
It's okay then.

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:48.790
Anyway, are you stalking me or something?

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:50.690
I'm sorry!

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:52.580
I know.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:55.770
Though I may look like an idiot but,

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.640
I like you, Senpai.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.120
Why are you shying away?

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:10.800
You wanted to do this with me, right?

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:14.220
No... uh... but... umm...

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.370
Then, why were you smothering yourself on my bed earlier?

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:19.460
<i>He saw that!?</i>

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:21.710
Uh-umm..

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:22.840
I'm so sorr-

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:24.640
You don't have to apologize so much.

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:29.420
I understand your feelings well.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:32.290
Um... Senpai?

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.210
W-What's wrong?

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:48.330
Your lips, don't shut them so tight.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:50.160
Huh!? Uh-Umm...

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:54.330
<i>This is bad...</i>

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:58.270
<i>My whole body is burning, tingling and going limp...</i>

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:00.270
Wait- no... Senpai!

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:03.310
Here, you touch me too.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.970
<i>What should I do? What should I do?</i>

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.920
<i>What should I do? What should I do?</i>

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:10.080
<i>At this rate...!</i>

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:15.850
I want to hold you.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:19.820
Okay.

00:09:28.340 --> 00:09:29.060
Ritsu.

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:35.480
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:39.570
<i>Just now, he called me by my name for the first time.</i>

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:51.860
I love you.

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:56.200
<i>What did you say just now?</i>

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.060
I love you.

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:06.460
<i>Did I hear it wrong?</i>

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:10.510
<i>But I really like Senpai.</i>

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:14.450
<i>If he could like me back , even just a little,</i>

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:20.060
<i>I'd be so happy that my heart would probably stop,
is what I thought .</i>

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:24.930
Fight!

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:31.740
Hey.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:32.960
Y-Yes!

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:36.000
I'm only teaching you since you said you didn't understand.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:39.120
Ah, yes! Th-That's right!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:43.990
Then how about paying a bit more attention.

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:45.800
Yes.

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:48.620
<i>It's impossible!</i>

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:50.700
I don't really care,

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:54.030
but it looks like you're using all the wrong forumlae.

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:55.020
Whoa!

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:57.070
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:10:57.390 --> 00:11:02.890
<i>That's right, when Senpai's sitting so close,
there's no way I can concentrate!</i>

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:09.030
<i>On top of that... we did it the night before last...</i>

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:12.250
<i>This is the first time we've met since then...</i>

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:13.790
<i>How to say it?</i>

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:17.310
<i>What happened that night was so embarrassing
that I could die,</i>

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:21.930
<i>but right now it's embarrassing in a totally different way.</i>

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:23.590
<i>Is your body alright?</i>

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:24.440
What!?

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.080
Not at all!

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:28.080
Ah, No...

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:31.020
It-It's okay.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:35.630
<i>I wish he'd stop looking at me so much.</i>

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.100
<i>It's making me nervous.</i>

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.050
Then, next

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.050
start from this question.

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:47.060
I-I'll go get a dictionary.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:49.670
<i>It's no good.</i>

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:52.800
<i>I'm obviously acting really suspicious.</i>

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:55.870
<i>I should just talk to him normally.</i>

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:59.230
<i>Senpai's making time especially for me.</i>

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:02.390
<i>I should just thank him and go home for today.</i>

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:05.600
Where did we get this?

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:08.210
I'll just put it anywhere.

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:11.460
Stop it. It'll be a pain for them to put it back in order later.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.690
Yes, yes. I got it already.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:20.940
<i>How long will it be before I can talk that naturally
with Senpai?</i>

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:26.550
You're doing Math, which has nothing to do with
a Japanese dictionary, right?

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:30.330
That's right.

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:34.220
Say, why have you been acting so strange today?

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:36.990
U-Umm... That's because...

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:40.460
Sorry.

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:47.590
When I'm sitting so close to you, my heart
starts beating like crazy.

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:54.580
<i>Did I put him off?</i>

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:57.930
Umm.. Sorry.

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.260
It's about time for me to go home for today.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.230
Uh, what about you, Senpai?

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.250
I'll be here until the library closes.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:13.390
You always stay here till late, isn't it?

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.630
It's boring at home anyway.

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:18.630
Why is that?

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:23.380
How to say this... my family is falling apart at the moment.

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.890
Sorry, I shouldn't have pried.

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:29.040
It's okay.

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:32.440
It's better now with the cat around.

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:35.390
<i>I see.</i>

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:39.250
<i>Now that he mentions it, I remember him saying
that he basically lived by himself.</i>

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.770
Want to stay over at my house tonight?

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:45.300
<i>Eh! Even if he asks that so suddenly...</i>

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.070
<i>Ah, but if my parents refuse, next time...!</i>

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.250
No, but I'll go tonight!

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.180
Which is it?

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:54.690
I-I'll go!

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:59.050
If it'll help you to not feel lonely, then I'll be
happy with that.

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.520
What's with that?

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:04.860
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:06.230
<i>Did I offend him?</i>

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:08.800
I-I'm sorry.

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.260
That's right,

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:14.440
even if I am together with you, it won't be of any help.

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:17.280
Um... I...

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:18.690
<i>But...</i>

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:23.990
I was just thinking that if there's anything I can do
for you, it would be nice.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:27.810
<i>If there's something I can do, I'll go anything.</i>

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:30.110
<i>Because it's you, Senpai.</i>

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.890
<i>Because I'm hopelessly in love with you.</i>

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:36.490
Sorry.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:42.080
I'm annoying, aren't I?

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:46.340
Um... then, I'll just go home for today.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.830
Thank you for helping me study-

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:49.720
That's not it.

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:00.360
Want to go to the karaoke on the way home?

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:02.250
Oh, great idea!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:05.250
Actually, there's a song I want to sing!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:06.100
Oh?

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:09.010
But should we get something to eat before that?

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.010
Yeah. That's fine. What do you want to eat?

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:12.170
Good question.

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:26.630
Um... Senpai...

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:32.740
Uh... we're at school...

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.860
We should do this at home...

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:36.940
I can't wait till we get home.

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:44.580
I told you.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:49.080
Don't shut your lips when we kiss.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.350
You did that the last time too.

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:54.930
Yes! Sorry.

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:59.390
Speaking of that, can you stop apologizing for everything?

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.580
Sorry.

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:04.050
Uh.. No... I mean...

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.400
Sorry!

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:10.070
I'm... usually alright with other people.

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:16.410
But when I'm with you, everything feels all muddled up...

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:20.560
I don't even know what I'm doing...

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:35.330
I was given a huge confession just now, isn't it?

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:38.160
Yes.

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:46.760
Why do you like me so much?

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.050
Why?

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:50.980
Because it's you Senpai.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:52.520
What's with that?

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:55.020
That's not an answer at all.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.700
<i>Through his softly murmuring voice,</i>

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:01.530
<i>I heard a hint of a smile.</i>

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:05.560
<i>Just by him speaking to me...</i>

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:09.750
<i>Just by him touching me...</i>

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:12.190
<i>And by smiling for me...</i>

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:16.240
<i>Why does it make my chest feel so tight?</i>

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:18.910
Are you crying?

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.060
I'm not crying.

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:26.640
Onodera...! Onodera!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:28.890
Where did Onodera go!?

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:34.260
What, you were here?

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.400
<i>A dream?</i>

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:39.770
<i>No, this is reality.</i>

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:43.460
Say, Takano-san! How can you step on someone like that!?

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:45.770
Sorry. I though it was trash.

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:48.180
Rit-chan... you know...

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:51.380
S-Sorry! I fell asleep in the war zone!

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:55.260
It's okay. You just passed out, that's all...

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:58.250
Could you photocopy this for me?

00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:01.050
Y-Yes! S-Sorry, sorry!

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:03.930
<i>Ah, I've got to get my act together!</i>

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.040
Onodera.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:06.580
What is it!?

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:09.060
No, nothing.

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:16.740
<i>At least let me have a sweet dream when I'm blacked out!</i>

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:20.970
<i>But, why was I dreaming about Takano-san, of all people!?</i>

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:25.420
No way, Onodera-kun, what is that?

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:27.200
On your back!

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:27.060
Stupid

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:30.870
And it's in extra large print too!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:32.870
Sorry, please take it off for me.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:34.870
Eh, but it was funny too.

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:36.280
It's not funny!

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:40.370
Takano-san! You realized it before, didn't you!?
Say something then!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:43.250
Towards someone who selfishly goes out cold without a word,

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:44.930
I have no such obligation.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:46.240
What!?

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.810
These newly arrived manuscripts, check them.

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:50.660
These many!?

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:54.100
Obviously, you should make up for the time you spent sleeping.

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:57.840
You had a happy face.

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:00.370
You must have had a pretty sweet dream.

00:19:01.770 --> 00:19:04.870
No, not at all! It was the worst nightmare.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:05.990
Is that so?

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:08.440
Oh, that's perfect.

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:09.380
What is it?

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:11.470
You should stick this on instead.

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:12.280
I love you

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:17.100
<i>This is bad, he really pisses me off...</i>

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:19.290
<i>This guy's got a terrible personality.</i>

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:23.730
<i>He's disagreeable, complaining, unthoughtful and a tyrant!</i>

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:31.830
<i>What the hell... Why do I have to dream of Takano-san,
of all people!?</i>

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:37.480
Ah, I think Rit-chan is starting to fit in here.

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:38.900
That's great.
